      "severity": "medium"
    }
  ],
  "suspicious_resources": [
    "Deployment/api",
    "ConfigMap/code"
  ],
  "significant_events": [],
  "preliminary_assessment": "The API Deployment is configured with a 50m CPU limit while its server code performs a 500,000-iteration PBKDF2 computation for every request to '/', which the load generator targets. This likely causes CPU throttling, elevated latency, and timeouts. The TCP-only readiness probe does not detect this application-level degradation. No Kubernetes events were provided, so event-based confirmation is unavailable."
}

